<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7' }}>AI 说的，软件会再核一遍</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 1 }}>不管结果是谁给的，写进数据前都得过这一关</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', opacity: 0.8 }}>可靠性设计</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 500, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>五类内容各有各的规矩：只认列举出来的这些，不合规就不写进去。</Text>
            <Table
                style={{ width: 700, height: 360 }}
                defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 15, textAlign: 'left', color: '#E8EEF7' }}
                defaultCellStyle={{
                    border: {
                        left: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.12)' },
                        right: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.12)' },
                        top: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.12)' },
                        bottom: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.12)' },
                    },
                }}
                cells={[
                    [
                        { text: '检查什么', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0B1220' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4FE0B0' } } },
                        { text: '只认这些', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0B1220' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4FE0B0' } } },
                        { text: '不合规怎么办', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0B1220' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#4FE0B0' } } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '类型', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.05)' } } },
                        '单次 / 每天 / 每周 / 每月',
                        { text: '退回「单次」', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                    [
                        '时间',
                        '合法的 时:分',
                        { text: '退回早上 9:00', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '星期', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.05)' } } },
                        '只能是 0–6',
                        { text: '越界的直接丢掉', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                    [
                        '日期',
                        '只能是 1–31',
                        { text: '越界的直接丢掉', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '系统操作', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.05)' } } },
                        '锁屏 / 关机 / 重启',
                        { text: '置空，不执行', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                    [
                        '标题',
                        '不能为空',
                        { text: '用你原来那句话', textStyle: { color: '#4FE0B0' } },
                    ],
                ]}
            />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 200, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.05)', border: '2px dashed rgba(79,224,176,0.55)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>截图 ⑯</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', textAlign: 'center' }}>解析结果页（标注来源）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>建议画面：展示结果旁边<br />「来自云端大模型 / 来自本机引擎」的标注</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10, padding: '18px 20px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.12)', border: '1px solid #4FE0B0', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>大模型只负责<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>提个建议</span>，能不能写进去由<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>软件说了算</span>。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>而且结果会先摆成一张表单，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>你点确认才真的写进去</span>——人一直在最后一道。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.6, lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>这一条不是嘴上说说：有专门的检查会故意喂进去一堆乱七八糟的字段，验证它们全被挡下。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>知歇 ZhiXie · V1.0.0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>16 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
